    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kgWFjmiqHmQ',
    description_ar: 'استكشاف مثير للفضول والخطأ للإغواء والحب الممنوع والفداء ، جحيم غابرييل هو قصة آسرة وعاطفية عن هروب رجل من جحيمه الشخصي بينما يحاول كسب المستحيل - الغفران والحب.',
    description_en: 'An intriguing and sinful exploration of seduction, forbidden love, and redemption, Gabriel\'s Inferno is a captivating and wildly passionate tale of one man\'s escape from his own personal hell as he tries to earn the impossible--forgiveness and love.',
    description_fr: 'Exploration intrigante et pécheresse de la séduction, de l\'amour interdit et de la rédemption, Gabriel\'s Inferno est un récit captivant et follement passionné de la fuite d\'un homme de son propre enfer, alors qu\'il tente de gagner l\'impossible, le pardon et l\'amour.',
    description_es: 'El enigmático y atractivo profesor Gabriel Emerson, reconocido especialista en Dante, es un hombre torturado por su pasado y orgulloso del prestigio que ha conseguido, aunque también es consciente de que es un imán para el pecado y, en especial, para la lujuria.',
    description_tr: 'Baştan çıkarma, yasak aşk ve kurtuluşun ilgi çekici ve günahkâr bir keşfi olan Gabriel\'s Inferno, bir adamın imkansızlığını - affetmeyi ve sevgiyi kazanmaya çalışırken kendi kişisel cehenneminden kaçışının büyüleyici ve çılgınca tutkulu bir hikayesidir.',
    description_de: 'An intriguing and sinful exploration of seduction, forbidden love, and redemption, Gabriel\'s Inferno is a captivating and wildly passionate tale of one man\'s escape from his own personal hell as he tries to earn the impossible--forgiveness and love.',
