    genres: ['crime', 'drama'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/taSfNqBkM6fVexayWLKcqHxMg7a.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dwzjaCNn4qzAY0Fu0AdqxhovSWE.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8WxlD7Wm2hE',
    description_ar: 'A story set in the 90s and in the outskirts of Rome to Ostia. A world where money, luxury cars, night clubs, cocaine and synthetic drugs are easy to run. A world in which Vittorio and Cesare, in their early twenties, act in search of their success.',
    description_en: 'A story set in the 90s and in the outskirts of Rome to Ostia. A world where money, luxury cars, night clubs, cocaine and synthetic drugs are easy to run. A world in which Vittorio and Cesare, in their early twenties, act in search of their success.',
    description_fr: '1995, près de Rome. Vittorio et Cesare qui se connaissent depuis 20 ans, sont  comme des frères inséparables. Leur quotidien se résume aux discothèques, à  l’alcool et aux trafics de drogues… Mais ils paient cher cette vie d’excès. Après  avoir rencontré Linda, Vittorio semble vouloir changer de vie. Cesare lui, plonge  inexorablement…',
    description_es: 'Años 90, en las afueras de Roma hacia Ostia, mismo lugar donde acontecían los films de Pasolini. Sus personajes, en los 90, parecen pertenecer a un mundo que gira alrededor del hedonismo. Un mundo donde el dinero, coches de lujo, clubes nocturnos, cocaína y drogas sintéticas son fáciles de encontrar. Un mundo donde Vittorio y Cesare, veinteañeros, van en busca de su propio éxito. El inicio de su existencia tendrá un alto precio para Vittorio: para salvarse a sí mismo, abandona a Cesare, que inexorablemente se hundirá. Pero el vínculo que los une es tan fuerte que en realidad Vittorio nunca le abandonará, siempre con la esperanza de afrontar el futuro con una nueva mirada. Juntos.',
    description_tr: 'Vittorio ve Cesare, birbirlerini uyuşturucu, alkol ve araba sevdasıyla harmanlayan, uçlarda sürünen iki yakın arkadaştır. Hayattan beklentileri bu marjinal ikiliye pahalıya patlamıştır. Günün birinde Vittorio, Linda ile tanışır ve Cesare’den uzaklaşır. Cesare’nin hayatı dibe vurunca Vittorio, ona tekrar destek olur. Uzak kaldıkları süre zarfında aralarındaki bağın daha da kuvvetlendiğini anlamışlardır ve beraber daha parlak bir gelecek geçireceklerini farkederler. Başarılı oyunculuklarla dikkat çeken bu trajikomik öykü, bu yıl İtalya’da en çok ses getiren filmlerden biri oldu.',
    description_de: 'A story set in the 90s and in the outskirts of Rome to Ostia. A world where money, luxury cars, night clubs, cocaine and synthetic drugs are easy to run. A world in which Vittorio and Cesare, in their early twenties, act in search of their success.',
    description_ja: 'A story set in the 90s and in the outskirts of Rome to Ostia. A world where money, luxury cars, night clubs, cocaine and synthetic drugs are easy to run. A world in which Vittorio and Cesare, in their early twenties, act in search of their success.',
    description_pt: 'A story set in the 90s and in the outskirts of Rome to Ostia. A world where money, luxury cars, night clubs, cocaine and synthetic drugs are easy to run. A world in which Vittorio and Cesare, in their early twenties, act in search of their success.',
