    id: '706', slug: 'my-left-foot-the-story-of-christy-brown', title: 'My Left Foot: The Story of Christy Brown', title_ar: 'My Left Foot: The Story of Christy Brown', year: 1989,
    director: 'Jim Sheridan', director_ar: 'Jim Sheridan',
    cast: ['Daniel Day-Lewis', 'Brenda Fricker', 'Alison Whelan', 'Kirsten Sheridan', 'Declan Croghan', 'Eanna MacLiam'],
    genres: ['drama'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zk9AMxji8j32UoCgLVZ6omDRekU.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zjKg04EquTcnVZUfjHboXnXzjcF.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xj7yME23Hes',
    description_ar: 'No one expects much from Christy Brown, a boy with cerebral palsy born into a working-class Irish family. Though Christy is a spastic quadriplegic and essentially paralyzed, a miraculous event occurs when, at the age of 5, he demonstrates control of his left foot by using chalk to scrawl a word on the floor. With the help of his steely mother — and no shortage of grit and determination — Christy overcomes his infirmity to become a painter, poet and author.',
    description_en: 'No one expects much from Christy Brown, a boy with cerebral palsy born into a working-class Irish family. Though Christy is a spastic quadriplegic and essentially paralyzed, a miraculous event occurs when, at the age of 5, he demonstrates control of his left foot by using chalk to scrawl a word on the floor. With the help of his steely mother — and no shortage of grit and determination — Christy overcomes his infirmity to become a painter, poet and author.',
    description_fr: 'Évocation de la vie de Christy Brown, peintre et écrivain, frappe d\'une paralysie spasmodique à la naissance, d’après ses Mémoires rédigés en 1954.',
    description_es: 'Christy Brown es un enfermo de parálisis cerebral, nacido en el seno de una numerosa y mísera familia irlandesa. Su madre es la única que lo ve como un chico con talento y sensibilidad. Con el tiempo, Christy se revela como un irascible pero talentoso escritor y pintor, que utiliza su pie izquierdo -la única parte de su cuerpo que tiene motricidad- como instrumento.',
    description_tr: 'Beyin felçli olarak doğan Christy Brown, hastalığı nedeniyle hareketlerini kontrol edemez ve tekerlekli sandalyeye mahkum bir yaşam sürer. Ancak çocukluğunda, sol ayağının felçten etkilenmediğinin farkına varması hayatını değiştirecektir. Christy sol ayağını kendine verilmiş bir şans olarak görür ve azmin de yardımıyla hastalığının etkilerini yenmeye çalışır. Bu çalışmanın sonucunda ise sakat vücudunun içinde gizli olan zeka ve yazma yeteneği ortaya çıkacaktır.',
    description_de: 'Preisgekrönte Verfilmung des gleichnamigen autobiografischen Romans von Christy Brown (1954). Das Drama dreht sich um das Leben des schwerbehinderten Christy, der zunächst fast vollständig gelähmt war, dann aber beginnend mit seinem linken Fuß immer beweglicher wurde. Daniel Day-Lewis erhielt für seine Darstellung Browns seinen ersten Oscar.',
    description_ja: '原作者C・ブラウンの実話を映画化した作品。生まれながらの重度の脳性小児麻痺により、左足が少し動かせるだけで、後は植物人間同様の生活を余儀なくされている不遇の主人公が、その絶え間ざる努力の末、やがて言語能力を取り戻し、わずかに動く左足を使い絵を描けるようになるまで成長していく姿を描く。',
    description_pt: 'Christy Brown, que nasceu com paralisia cerebral, aprende a pintar e a escrever com o seu único membro controlável - o pé esquerdo.',
    rating_overall: 7.6, rating_story: 7.6, rating_acting: 7.7, rating_direction: 7.5, rating_cinematography: 7.3, rating_music: 7.1,
    imdb_rating: 7.5, rotten_tomatoes: 75,
    budget_million: 0.6,
    box_office_million: 15,
