    id: '711', slug: 'the-crow', title: 'The Crow', title_ar: 'The Crow', year: 1994,
    director: 'Alex Proyas', director_ar: 'Alex Proyas',
    cast: ['Brandon Lee', 'Rochelle Davis', 'Ernie Hudson', 'Michael Wincott', 'Bai Ling', 'Sofia Shinas'],
    genres: ['drama', 'action', 'thriller'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMMB3v6jYHjsvXRNJYESacoTD7j.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2VN9umruwVZsT1Pr1NMCV71HpUu.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ltzov6nhud0',
    description_ar: 'Exactly one year after young rock guitarist Eric Draven and his fiancée are brutally killed by a ruthless gang of criminals, Draven, watched over by a hypnotic crow, returns from the grave to exact revenge.',
    description_en: 'Exactly one year after young rock guitarist Eric Draven and his fiancée are brutally killed by a ruthless gang of criminals, Draven, watched over by a hypnotic crow, returns from the grave to exact revenge.',
    description_fr: 'Eric Draven et sa fiancée sont brutalement assassinés chez eux par un gang de criminels notoires. Un an plus tard, un mystérieux corbeau sort Eric de sa tombe et le ramène sur les lieux de l\'assassinat. Désormais doté d\'une vision exceptionnelle et de pouvoirs surnaturels, Eric va se venger de ses agresseurs qui mettent la ville à feu et à sang.',
    description_es: 'Eric Draven y Shelly Websyter están a punto de casarse, pero la noche antes del enlace son asesinados brutalmente. Un año después, el alma de Eric vuelve a la Tierra en forma de cuervo para vengarse.',
    description_tr: 'Rock yıldızı Eric Draven (Brandon Lee) ve kız arkadaşı Shelly Webster (Sofia Shinas) bir gece şehrin zalim serserileri tarafından vahşice öldürülürler. Tam olarak bir sene sonra Eric, insanüstü güç ve öngörü yetileriyle donanmış bir şekilde hayata geri döner. Gizemli bir karganın rehberliğiyle hareket eden Eric, intikam amacıyla kendisini öldürenlerin peşine düşer. Çete ise kendilerini bekleyen kaderden habersiz, bir başka kaos ve şiddet gecesine hazırlanmaktadır. James O\'Barr\'ın popüler çizgi romanından sinemaya uyarlanan Ölümsüz Aşk\'ın yönetmen koltuğunda ise Alex Proyas oturuyor.',
    description_de: 'Halloween, die Nacht des Teufels. Der junge Rockgitarrist Eric Draven und seine Verlobte werden in ihrer Wohnung von einer Street-Gang überfallen und brutal ermordet. Ein Jahr danach erweckt eine magische Krähe den toten Eric wieder zum Leben. Unverwundbar und ausgestattet mit übernatürlichen Kräften, nimmt er unnachsichtig Rache an den Bandenmitgliedern und ihrem Auftraggeber.',
    description_ja: 'Exactly one year after young rock guitarist Eric Draven and his fiancée are brutally killed by a ruthless gang of criminals, Draven, watched over by a hypnotic crow, returns from the grave to exact revenge.',
    description_pt: 'Eric Draven, um jovem guitarrista, é atacado e assassinado com a sua noiva. Exactamente um ano depois, Eric regressa à vida graças à acção de um corvo que transporta a sua alma. Agora, dotado de força e visão sobrenaturais, não irá dar tréguas aos criminosos responsáveis pela sua morte.',
    rating_overall: 7.6, rating_story: 7.6, rating_acting: 7.7, rating_direction: 7.5, rating_cinematography: 7.3, rating_music: 7.1,
    imdb_rating: 7.5, rotten_tomatoes: 75,
