    id: '730', slug: 'how-the-grinch-stole-christmas', title: 'How the Grinch Stole Christmas!', title_ar: 'How the Grinch Stole Christmas!', year: 1966,
    director: 'Chuck Jones', director_ar: 'Chuck Jones',
    cast: ['Boris Karloff', 'June Foray', 'Dal McKennon', 'Thurl Ravenscroft'],
    genres: ['animation', 'drama', 'comedy'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ir0iRuPK9OEuH569cp0nF5CJce.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1Q5b34cge5nClCpamxf3HkU18W1.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8J1AXS8C20M',
    description_ar: 'Bitter and hateful, the Grinch is irritated at the thought of a nearby village having a happy time celebrating Christmas. Disguised as Santa Claus, with his dog made to look like a reindeer, he decides to raid the village to steal all the Christmas things.',
    description_en: 'Bitter and hateful, the Grinch is irritated at the thought of a nearby village having a happy time celebrating Christmas. Disguised as Santa Claus, with his dog made to look like a reindeer, he decides to raid the village to steal all the Christmas things.',
    description_fr: 'Tous les habitants de Douxville, les Doux n\'ont qu\'une hâte : préparer Noël. Tous sauf le Grinch qui rumine sa vengeance depuis son exil forcé. Ce croque-mitaine de poils verts décide d\'enfiler le costume du Père Noël et de gâcher la nuit du réveillon des Doux. Pour finalement découvrir que l\'esprit de Noël ne se réduit pas aux jouets, chants, parades et autres présents, mais veut vraiment dire quelque chose.',
    description_es: 'Amargo y odioso, el Grinch se irrita ante la idea de que una aldea cercana se divierta celebrando la Navidad. Disfrazado de Santa Claus, con su perro hecho para parecer un reno, decide asaltar el pueblo para robar todas las cosas navideñas.',
    description_tr: 'Komedi ustası jim carrey bu sefer çirkinmi çirkin huysuzmu huysuz grinç rolünde karşımıza çıkıyor. yine kahkaha garantisi veren filmde yılbaşından hoşlanmayan grinçin yaşadığı kasabadaki halka bir sürprizi vardır.',
    description_de: 'Jeder Wer in Wer-Stadt liebt das Weihnachtsfest sehr. Nur der Grinch, der nördlich von Wer-Stadt lebt, der nicht! Deshalb versucht er in diesem Jahr, den fröhlichen Bewohnern während des Schlafs das Weihnachtsfest zu rauben.',
    description_ja: 'Bitter and hateful, the Grinch is irritated at the thought of a nearby village having a happy time celebrating Christmas. Disguised as Santa Claus, with his dog made to look like a reindeer, he decides to raid the village to steal all the Christmas things.',
    description_pt: 'O amargo Grinch, irritado com a alegria natalina que toma conta de seus vizinhos, decide disfarçar-se de Papai Noel e roubar todos os presentes e enfeites do vilarejo.',
    rating_overall: 7.6, rating_story: 7.6, rating_acting: 7.7, rating_direction: 7.5, rating_cinematography: 7.3, rating_music: 7.1,
