    id: '744', slug: 'batman-mask-of-the-phantasm', title: 'Batman: Mask of the Phantasm', title_ar: 'Batman: Mask of the Phantasm', year: 1993,
    director: 'Bruce Timm', director_ar: 'Bruce Timm',
    cast: ['Kevin Conroy', 'Dana Delany', 'Hart Bochner', 'Stacy Keach', 'Mark Hamill', 'Abe Vigoda'],
    genres: ['animation', 'crime', 'thriller'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hT4ehUteagUrhUOHAtmYiY7mp5l.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cMUuAgVsMWOCawXonZ4D1dSMd6h.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=imtYrQEZ4H8',
    description_ar: 'Andrea Beaumont leaves her father to return to Gotham, rekindling an old romance with Bruce Wayne. At the same time, a mysterious figure begins to hunt down Gotham\'s criminals, wrongly implicating Batman in the murders. Now on the run from the law, Batman must find and stop the culprit, while also navigating his relationship with Andrea.',
    description_en: 'Andrea Beaumont leaves her father to return to Gotham, rekindling an old romance with Bruce Wayne. At the same time, a mysterious figure begins to hunt down Gotham\'s criminals, wrongly implicating Batman in the murders. Now on the run from the law, Batman must find and stop the culprit, while also navigating his relationship with Andrea.',
    description_fr: 'Un parrain de la pègre est assassiné par un mysterieux fantome. Le nouveau procureur Arthur Reeves accuse Batman. Désormais traqué, Batman enquête pour retrouver le véritable meurtrier. Mais dans le même temps, Bruce Wayne retrouve aussi une ancienne petite-amie, Andréa Beaumont, dont le père fut autrefois mêlé aux affaires des gangsters tués. L\'occasion pour le chevalier noir de replonger dans son passé, à l\'époque où il faillit renoncer à devenir un justicier...  Entre introspection et action le film retrace les dilemmes rongeant interieurement Bruce Wayne',
    description_es: 'Una enigmática figura fantasmal hace su aparición, cumpliendo las ejecuciones de determinadas figuras importantes del hampa. Simultáneamente regresa a Gotham una muchacha con la cual Bruce Wayne mantuvo un idilio; éste rememorará su relación con la chica y, de paso, su propio «nacimiento» como Batman.',
    description_tr: 'Bruce Wayne\'nin nasıl Batman olmak için karar verdiğinin arada flashbacklerle anlatıldığı, Andrea Beaumont\'un Bruce\'un kararındaki rolünü ve joker ile ilgili güzel bir süprizi içeren bir Batman animasyon filmi. Ayrıca Batman\'in motorsikletli göründüğü ender sahnelerden birine sahiptir.',
    description_de: 'Dunkle Gestalten bedrohen Gotham City, es ist Zeit für die Rückkehr des schwarzen Rächers... Nach der erfolgreichen Serie der erste abendfüllende Kultfilm zur Kultfigur - perfekte Animation im "Dark-Deko-Stil"!',
    description_ja: 'Andrea Beaumont leaves her father to return to Gotham, rekindling an old romance with Bruce Wayne. At the same time, a mysterious figure begins to hunt down Gotham\'s criminals, wrongly implicating Batman in the murders. Now on the run from the law, Batman must find and stop the culprit, while also navigating his relationship with Andrea.',
    description_pt: 'Desenho animado no qual o Homem-Morcego combate o Fantasma, um novo bandido que mata um grande criminoso e faz parecer que o herói encapuçado cometeu o crime, fazendo com que Gotham City se volte contra ele. Além disso, Batman ainda precisa se preocupar em defender a cidade do Coringa',
    rating_overall: 7.6, rating_story: 7.6, rating_acting: 7.7, rating_direction: 7.5, rating_cinematography: 7.3, rating_music: 7.1,
    imdb_rating: 7.5, rotten_tomatoes: 75,
    budget_million: 6.0,
    box_office_million: 6,
    duration: 76, language: 'EN', country: 'US',
    reviews_count: 2300, is_featured: false, release_date: '1993-12-25', tags: ['animation', 'crime', 'mystery', '1993', 'timm'],
