    id: '999', slug: 'submarine', title: 'Submarine', title_ar: 'Submarine', year: 2011,
    director: 'Richard Ayoade', director_ar: 'Richard Ayoade',
    cast: ['Noah Taylor', 'Paddy Considine', 'Craig Roberts', 'Yasmin Paige', 'Sally Hawkins', 'Steffan Rhodri'],
    genres: ['drama', 'comedy', 'romance'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbzXX3CYtKUBrPeMcG7PVoLQHXB.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zaa2noUk2Dm6IgdTWWEe4WpL08o.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6CAntLzsQ74',
    description_ar: '15-year-old deep-thinking Welsh schoolboy Oliver Tate struggles to initiate and maintain a relationship with Jordana, his devilish, dark-haired classmate at their Swansea high school. As his parents\' marriage begins to fall apart, similar problems arise in his relationship with Jordana.',
    description_en: '15-year-old deep-thinking Welsh schoolboy Oliver Tate struggles to initiate and maintain a relationship with Jordana, his devilish, dark-haired classmate at their Swansea high school. As his parents\' marriage begins to fall apart, similar problems arise in his relationship with Jordana.',
    description_fr: 'À 15 ans, Oliver Tate a deux gros problèmes : il rêve de coucher avec sa petite amie et sa mère est en train de se laisser séduire par un gourou. Pour empêcher le pire et réussir le meilleur, Oliver n’a que deux atouts : un vocabulaire incroyablement riche et une immense confiance en lui…',
    description_es: 'Oliver Tate (Craig Roberts) es un peculiar joven de 15 años que tiene dos objetivos: impedir que su madre deje a su padre y encontrarse a sí mismo aunque sea a través de una chica, Jordana.',
    description_tr: 'Sosyal yetileri gelişmemiş ve yalnız olan on beş yaşındaki Oliver, ailesiyle bir çok problem yaşamaktadır. Oliver, bu sorunların üstesinden gelebileceğini ve ailesini tekrar bir araya getirebileceğini düşünür.',
    description_de: 'Der 15-jährige Oliver Tate hält sich für besonders intelligent und beliebt. Doch das Mädchen seiner Träume, seine Klassenkameradin Jordana  scheint kaum an Oliver interessiert zu sein. Als er endlich ihre Aufmerksamkeit gewinnen kann und die beiden ein Paar werden, hat er ein neues Ziel: er will sein erstes Mal mit ihr verbringen. Derweil kriselt das Eheleben zwischen seinen Eltern Jill  und Lloyd Tate und die größte Gefahr scheint von dem verführerischen Nachbarn Graham auszugehen. Nun muss Oliver nicht nur Jordana bei Laune halten, sondern auch die Ehe seiner Eltern vor dem Aus retten.',
    description_ja: '15-year-old deep-thinking Welsh schoolboy Oliver Tate struggles to initiate and maintain a relationship with Jordana, his devilish, dark-haired classmate at their Swansea high school. As his parents\' marriage begins to fall apart, similar problems arise in his relationship with Jordana.',
    description_pt: 'Na cabeça de Oliver Tate, um adolescente de 15 anos, ele é cool, um génio literário. Na realidade, é socialmente incapaz e bastante impopular. Oliver estabeleceu dois objetivos para o verão: perder a virgindade antes do seu próximo aniversário, com Jordana e evitar que a mãe troque o seu pai por um guru new age…',
