    id: '1334', slug: 'm3gan-2-0', title: 'M3GAN 2.0', title_ar: 'ميغان ٢.٠', year: 2025,
    director: 'Gerard Johnstone', director_ar: 'Gerard Johnstone',
    cast: ['Allison Williams', 'Amie Donald', 'Violet McGraw', 'Jenna Davis', 'Brian Jordan Alvarez', 'Jen Van Epps'],
    genres: ['action', 'scifi', 'thriller'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oekamLQrwlJjRNmfaBE4llIvkir.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cT9ZfwoPDk8JbgkessmQgxAWiaM.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1FeiTZMtwLA',
    description_ar: 'بعد أن تمكنت (جيمّا) من صنع دمية تشبه فتاة حقيقية، سرعان ما تنكشف الحقائق المرعبة للذكاء الاصطناعي، وتتزايد المخاوف بشأن ما يمكن أن تفعله فتاة آلية تدب فيها الحياة.',
    description_en: 'After the underlying tech for M3GAN is stolen and misused by a powerful defense contractor to create a military-grade weapon known as Amelia, M3GAN\'s creator Gemma realizes that the only option is to resurrect M3GAN and give her a few upgrades, making her faster, stronger, and more lethal.',
    description_fr: 'Deux ans ont passé depuis la destruction de M3GAN, le prototype à la pointe de l’intelligence artificielle devenu incontrôlable lors d’un carnage aussi sanglant qu’impeccablement chorégraphié. Sa créatrice Gemma aujourd’hui auteure de renom milite pour l’encadrement drastique des I.A. par le gouvernement, alors que Cady, sa nièce de 14 ans entre dans l’adolescence et se rebelle contre les règles trop strictes de sa tante. Cependant, à l’insu de tous, la technique de pointe mise au point pour M3GAN a été volée et détournée pour créer une arme militaire connue sous le nom d\'AM3LIA.',
    description_es: 'Con el futuro de la existencia humana en juego, Gemma se da cuenta de que la única opción es resucitar a M3GAN y darle unas cuantas mejoras, haciéndola más rápida, más fuerte y más letal.',
    description_tr: 'M3GAN geri döndü! Bu sefer yalnız değil. Efsanevi katil bebeğin kanlı katliamının üzerinden iki yıl geçmiştir. Yaratıcısı Gemma, ünlü bir yazar olmuştur ve yapay zekanın kontrolü için mücadele etmektedir. Yeğeni Cady ise çoktan asi bir genç olmuştur. Bu arada güçlü bir askeri şirket, M3GAN\'ın temel teknolojisini kullanarak yeni bir süper silah yaratır: Amelia. Hızlı, zeki ve insanlardan emir almamaktadır. Gemma, dünyayı kurtarmak için M3GAN\'ı geri almak zorundadır. Ancak bu sefer daha güçlü, daha tehlikeli ve daha çılgın olmak zorundadır.',
    description_de: 'Sie ist wieder da, allerdings nicht alleine.  Amelia die neuste Entwicklung einer Rüstungsfirma, basiert auf der Technologie von M3gan. Allerdings wird Amelia abtrünnig und nur die Wiedererweckte M3gan kann sie aufhalten.',
    description_ja: 'ブラムハウスとジェイムズ・ワン監督のタッグによるホラー『M3GAN ミーガン』の続編。前作から2年後を舞台に、ミーガンの基礎技術を盗用して生まれた軍用アンドロイドが暴走し、ジェマが奮闘する姿を描く。',
    description_pt: 'After the underlying tech for M3GAN is stolen and misused by a powerful defense contractor to create a military-grade weapon known as Amelia, M3GAN\'s creator Gemma realizes that the only option is to resurrect M3GAN and give her a few upgrades, making her faster, stronger, and more lethal.',
    rating_overall: 7.3, rating_story: 7.3, rating_acting: 7.4, rating_direction: 7.2, rating_cinematography: 7, rating_music: 6.8,
