    id: '1338', slug: 'wake-up-dead-man-a-knives-out-mystery', title: 'Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery', title_ar: 'عودة الرجل الميت: أخرجوا السكاكين', year: 2025,
    director: 'Rian Johnson', director_ar: 'Rian Johnson',
    cast: ['Daniel Craig', 'Josh O\'Connor', 'Glenn Close', 'Josh Brolin', 'Mila Kunis', 'Jeremy Renner'],
    genres: ['thriller', 'comedy'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCOGGi8JBVEZMc3DVby8rUivyXz.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fiRDzpcJe7qz3yIR43hdXIE3NHv.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0hc8yz5-d5Y',
    description_ar: 'يتعاون المحقق "بينوا بلون " مع كاهن شاب متفانٍ للتحقيق في جريمة معقدة للغاية في كنيسة بلدة صغيرة تُخفي تاريخًا غامضًا.',
    description_en: 'When young priest Jud Duplenticy is sent to assist charismatic firebrand Monsignor Jefferson Wicks, it’s clear that all is not well in the pews. After a sudden and seemingly impossible murder rocks the town, the lack of an obvious suspect prompts local police chief Geraldine Scott to join forces with renowned detective Benoit Blanc to unravel a mystery that defies all logic.',
    description_fr: 'Le détective Benoit Blanc collabore avec un jeune prêtre pour enquêter sur un crime totalement inexplicable perpétré dans l\'église d\'une petite ville au sombre passé.',
    description_es: 'El detective Benoit Blanc se une a un joven y honesto sacerdote para investigar un crimen totalmente imposible en la iglesia de un pequeño pueblo con una oscura historia.',
    description_tr: 'Dedektif Benoit Blanc karanlık bir geçmişi olan küçük kasaba kilisesinde işlenen ve imkânsız bir suçun kusursuz bir örneği olan cinayeti araştırmak için genç bir rahiple birlik olur.',
    description_de: 'Der Detektiv Benoit Blanc arbeitet mit einem jungen Priester zusammen, um ein absolut unmögliches Verbrechen in einer Kirche mit dunkler Vergangenheit zu lösen.',
    description_ja: '名探偵ブノワ・ブランが若き実直な神父と手を組み、ある田舎町の教会で起こった絶対に実行不可能と思える犯罪の捜査にあたる。その教会には忌まわしい過去があった。',
    description_pt: 'O detetive Benoit Blanc une-se a um jovem padre para investigar um crime perfeitamente impossível ocorrido na igreja de uma pequena cidade com uma história obscura.',
