    id: '1430', slug: 'eighth-grade', title: 'Eighth Grade', title_ar: 'فتاة الصف الثامن', year: 2018,
    director: 'Bo Burnham', director_ar: 'Bo Burnham',
    cast: ['Elsie Fisher', 'Josh Hamilton', 'Emily Robinson', 'Jake Ryan', 'Daniel Zolghadri', 'Fred Hechinger'],
    genres: ['comedy', 'drama'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTa9cLhGHfQ7084UvoPQ2bBXKqd.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nDfZN2q1IPGaLiwAgr9sU209MU5.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y8lFgF_IjPw',
    description_ar: 'رغم عزلتها الاجتماعية ومخاوفها من المدرسة الثانوية، تستجمع فتاة خجولة في الصف الثامن تفاؤلها لتجتاز الأسبوع الأخير من المرحلة الإعدادية.',
    description_en: 'Thirteen-year-old Kayla endures the tidal wave of contemporary suburban adolescence as she makes her way through the last week of middle school — the end of her thus far disastrous eighth grade year — before she begins high school.',
    description_fr: 'Kayla Day a toujours son téléphone en main, espérant trouver des connexions en ligne qui pourraient compenser celles qu\'elle est incapable de forger dans sa vie de tous les jours. Elle réalise des vidéos YouTube destinées à d\'autres adolescents confrontés à des problèmes similaires - sentiments d\'isolement, d\'anxiété et d\'invisibilité - mais après avoir si facilement mobilisé cette sagesse et cette confiance en s\'adressant à son auditoire (à peine existant), Kayla la trouve paralysante . Au cours de la dernière semaine d\'une année scolaire si désastreuse et avec le lycée qui se profile à l\'horizon, Kayla s\'efforce de combler le fossé qui sépare la façon dont elle se perçoit et la personne qu\'elle croit devoir être.',
    description_es: 'Narra la historia de Kayla, una joven de trece años que está viviendo la transición entre niña y adolescente. Intentará superar el último desastroso curso de la escuela, para poder comenzar una nueva etapa en el instituto.',
    description_tr: 'Kayla Day, ortaokul son sınıfta okuyan bir öğrencidir. Liseye geçişini sağlayacak olan dönem sonu yalnızca 1 hafta uzaktadır. 1 hafta sonra ortaokul hayatı bitecek ve yepyeni bir sayfa açılmış olacaktır. Ancak bu hayat değiştiren deneyime ulaşabilmek için genç kızın 1 hafta daha bu kabus gibi ortaokul hayatına katlanması, sorunlarla başa çıkması ve dayanıklı olması gereklidir.',
    description_de: 'Die 13-jährige Einzelgängerin Kayla muss das letzte Jahr der Middle School, also die achte Klasse, irgendwie überstehen, um endlich die Highschool besuchen zu können, denn es ist nicht einfach eine Jugendliche aus einer Vorstadt zu sein.',
    description_ja: 'Thirteen-year-old Kayla endures the tidal wave of contemporary suburban adolescence as she makes her way through the last week of middle school — the end of her thus far disastrous eighth grade year — before she begins high school.',
    description_pt: 'Apesar do seu isolamento social e dos receios do secundário, uma tímida adolescente consegue encontrar otimismo para ultrapassar a última semana do ensino básico.',
    rating_overall: 7.3, rating_story: 7.3, rating_acting: 7.4, rating_direction: 7.2, rating_cinematography: 7, rating_music: 6.8,
    imdb_rating: 7.2, rotten_tomatoes: 72,
    budget_million: 2.0,
    box_office_million: 14,
    duration: 94, language: 'EN', country: 'US',
    reviews_count: 4390, is_featured: false, release_date: '2018-01-19', tags: ['comedy', 'drama', '2018', 'burnham'],
