    id: '1439', slug: 'the-land-before-time', title: 'The Land Before Time', title_ar: 'الأرض قبل الزمن', year: 1988,
    director: 'Don Bluth', director_ar: 'Don Bluth',
    cast: ['Gabriel Damon', 'Candace Hutson', 'Will Ryan', 'Judith Barsi', 'Helen Shaver', 'Pat Hingle'],
    genres: ['drama', 'animation', 'adventure'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSC2wxFj3ZgrIHlIaePeuHN4igo.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sXfQGa7juaTpZ5IF17Xa6hI53nx.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4BInhb4GkG8',
    description_ar: 'An orphaned brontosaurus named Littlefoot sets off in search of the legendary Great Valley. A land of lush vegetation where the dinosaurs can thrive and live in peace. Along the way he meets four other young dinosaurs, each one a different species, and they encounter several obstacles as they learn to work together in order to survive.',
    description_en: 'An orphaned brontosaurus named Littlefoot sets off in search of the legendary Great Valley. A land of lush vegetation where the dinosaurs can thrive and live in peace. Along the way he meets four other young dinosaurs, each one a different species, and they encounter several obstacles as they learn to work together in order to survive.',
    description_fr: 'La sècheresse pousse les derniers dinosaures à s\'exiler. En route vers la fertile vallée des Merveilles, Petit-Pied, un jeune brontosaure de la famille herbivore des Longs Cous, est séparé de sa famille par l\'attaque d\'un dinosaure carnivore, un Dent Tranchante, qui tue sa mère. Un violent séisme finit d\'isoler Petit-Pied, qui chemine désormais seul. Mais il rencontre bientôt trois dinosaures de son âge, Cera, Petrie et Becky, qui vont l\'accompagner dans son périple. Mais pour les quatre jeunes aventuriers, la route est longue et les dangers sont multiples.',
    description_es: 'Aclamada película de animación que narra las aventuras de unos pequeños dinosaurios en su viaje por alcanzar el Gran Valle, el único sitio de la tierra que todavía no ha sido alcanzado por una plaga devastadora',
    description_tr: 'Beş yetim dinazor, yıkıntıya dönmüş dünyalarında,hayatta kalabilmek için, ailelerini kaybetmenin yasını bir kenara bırakıp birlik olurlar. Birbirinden şirin dinazorcuklar, tarih öncesi çağın bu zalim coğrafyasında ne yapacaklardır ? Çocuklar kadar, büyüklerin de izlemesi gereken bir ölüm-kalım hikayesi.',
    description_de: 'In einem längst vergangenen Zeitalter ist der kleine Bracheosaurier Littlefoot, nach dem plötzlichen Tod seiner Mutter, ganz alleine. So macht er sich auf, das "Große Tal" zu finden, in dem es noch Nahrung im Überfluss geben soll. Dabei trifft er auf vier weitere Jungsaurier, die sich ihm auf seiner Suche anschließen. Ihre wagemutige Reise durch die fremde Urwelt ist voller Abenteuer…',
    description_ja: 'An orphaned brontosaurus named Littlefoot sets off in search of the legendary Great Valley. A land of lush vegetation where the dinosaurs can thrive and live in peace. Along the way he meets four other young dinosaurs, each one a different species, and they encounter several obstacles as they learn to work together in order to survive.',
    description_pt: 'Esta viagem mágica começa há muitos anos, quando os dinossauros ainda vagueavam num lugar ameaçado por tremores de terra e vulcões. Pezinho, sozinho, decide procurar o Vale Encantado, uma terra de vegetação luxuriante, onde todos os dinossauros vivem em paz. Ao longo do percurso, encontra quatro novos amigos e juntos, vão viver incríveis aventuras, encontrarão terríveis obstáculos e aprenderão lições inesquecíveis sobre a vida e o verdadeiro significado da amizade.',
    rating_overall: 7.3, rating_story: 7.3, rating_acting: 7.4, rating_direction: 7.2, rating_cinematography: 7, rating_music: 6.8,
    imdb_rating: 7.2, rotten_tomatoes: 72,
    budget_million: 12.5,
    box_office_million: 85,
    duration: 69, language: 'EN', country: 'US',
    reviews_count: 4576, is_featured: false, release_date: '1988-11-18', tags: ['family', 'animation', 'adventure', '1988', 'bluth'],
