    id: '1732', slug: 'after-we-fell', title: 'After We Fell', title_ar: 'بعد سقوطنا', year: 2021,
    director: 'Castille Landon', director_ar: 'Castille Landon',
    cast: ['Josephine Langford', 'Hero Fiennes Tiffin', 'Carter Jenkins', 'Louise Lombard', 'Chance Perdomo', 'Rob Estes'],
    genres: ['drama', 'romance'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dU4HfnTEJDf9KvxGS9hgO7BVeju.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mxdiaM2tsx8M6W3zLgiPwAkhQfq.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NYdNN6C9hfI',
    description_ar: 'يتغير كل شيء عندما تتخذ تيسا أكبر قرار في حياتها بالكشف عن أسرار عائلتها، ثم يتبعها هاردين فيُصبح عليهما الكفاح من أجل علاقتهما وطريقهما شديد الصعوبة.',
    description_en: 'Just as Tessa\'s life begins to become unglued, nothing is what she thought it would be. Not her friends nor her family. The only person that she should be able to rely on is Hardin, who is furious when he discovers the massive secret that she\'s been keeping. Before Tessa makes the biggest decision of her life, everything changes because of revelations about her family.',
    description_fr: 'Tessa entame un nouveau chapitre de sa vie, mais alors qu’elle se prépare à emménager à Seattle pour son job de rêves, la jalousie et le comportement imprévisible d’Hardin s’intensifient et menacent leur relation. La situation se complique davantage lorsque le père de Tessa fait son retour et que des révélations choquantes sur la famille d’Hardin surgissent. Tessa et Hardin vont alors devoir décider si leur amour vaut la peine de se battre ou s’il est temps pour eux de prendre des chemins différents.',
    description_es: 'Cuando Tessa toma la decisión más importante de su vida, todo cambia. Los secretos que salen a la luz sobre su familia y la de Hardin ponen en peligro su relación y su futuro juntos. La vida de Tessa empieza a romperse en pedazos y ya nada será como antes. Aunque sabe que Hardin la quiere, estas dos almas perdidas están rodeadas de celos, odio... y perdón. Hasta ahora, el amor era suficiente para mantener su relación a flote, pero ¿de verdad sigue mereciendo la pena?',
    description_tr: 'Hayatının en önemli kararını vermesinin ardından Tessa’nın yaşamı tamamen değişir. Hayallerindeki iş için Seattle\'a taşınmaya hazırlanırken Hardin\'in kıskançlığı ve öngörülemeyen davranışları alevlenir. Ailesi hakkında ortaya çıkan sırlar, Hardin hakkında öğrendikleri hayatının daha da karışmasına neden olur. Aşkları savaşmaya değer mi, yoksa ayrılıp kendi yollarına gitme zamanı mı geldiğine karar vermelidirler.',
    description_de: 'Gerade als Tessa die größte Entscheidung ihres Lebens trifft, ändert sich alles. Die einzige Person, auf die sie sich verlassen kann, ist Hardin. Enthüllungen über ihre Familien stellen jedoch bald alles, was sie bisher wussten, in Frage und erschweren ihre hart erkämpfte gemeinsame Zukunft.',
    description_ja: 'Just as Tessa\'s life begins to become unglued, nothing is what she thought it would be. Not her friends nor her family. The only person that she should be able to rely on is Hardin, who is furious when he discovers the massive secret that she\'s been keeping. Before Tessa makes the biggest decision of her life, everything changes because of revelations about her family.',
    description_pt: 'Tessa acabou de tomar a maior decisão de sempre, mas tudo muda com novas revelações sobre a sua família. A sua vida começa a desabar. Nada é como ela pensava. Os amigos. A família. Até Hardin, a única pessoa em quem ela poderia confiar, fica furioso quando descobre o segredo que ela guarda.',
    rating_overall: 7.1, rating_story: 7.1, rating_acting: 7.2, rating_direction: 7, rating_cinematography: 6.8, rating_music: 6.6,
