    id: '1745', slug: 'say-anything', title: 'Say Anything...', title_ar: 'Say Anything...', year: 1989,
    director: 'Cameron Crowe', director_ar: 'Cameron Crowe',
    cast: ['John Cusack', 'Ione Skye', 'John Mahoney', 'Lili Taylor', 'Amy Brooks', 'Pamela Adlon'],
    genres: ['romance', 'comedy', 'drama'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkucKciFGSRalw6dJtsglWqOXMC.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bAdIO0Jt886Ad1eY9bDXXeCpXsV.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Se_eSeEAoX0',
    description_ar: 'Average student and eternal optimist Lloyd Dobler seeks to capture the heart of Diane Court, a beautiful but unattainable valedictorian classmate. He surprises just about everyone - including himself - when she returns the sentiment. However, Diane\'s divorced, over-protective father soon begins to disapprove of the match, and Lloyd realises that it\'s going to take more than just the power of love to conquer all.',
    description_en: 'Average student and eternal optimist Lloyd Dobler seeks to capture the heart of Diane Court, a beautiful but unattainable valedictorian classmate. He surprises just about everyone - including himself - when she returns the sentiment. However, Diane\'s divorced, over-protective father soon begins to disapprove of the match, and Lloyd realises that it\'s going to take more than just the power of love to conquer all.',
    description_fr: 'Lloyd Dobler ne veut qu\'une et une seule chose : réussir à sortir avec la belle et intelligente Diane Court.',
    description_es: 'Lloyd Dobler, un eterno optimista, busca conseguir el corazón de Diane Court, una inalcanzable belleza del instituto, además de una intachable estudiante. Todo el mundo se sorprende, incluido Lloyd, cuando ella demuestra que el sentimiento es recíproco. Pero el posesivo padre divorciado de Diane no aprueba esa relación, y hará falta algo más que el poder del amor para que consigan seguir juntos.',
    description_tr: 'Lloyd Dobler (Cusack), asi, hafif sorumsuz, dünyayı tozpembe gören, ilk bakışta sıradan bir tiptir. Lisenin en çalışkan ve güzel kızı Diane\'e (Skye) aşık olur. Genç kızın dul ve onu aşırı sahiplenmiş babası James Court (Mahoney) iki gencin ilişkisine karşı çıkınca, Lloyd önündeki engelleri aşmak için duygularından daha fazla şeye ihtiyaç duyacaktır.',
    description_de: 'Der 19jährige Lloyd, ein mittelmäßiger Schüler ohne berufliche Ambitionen, verliebt sich ausgerechnet in die wohlbehütete Diane, der alle Türen zu einer großen Karriere offenstehen. Seine Natürlichkeit beeindruckt die Musterschülerin, die bald seine Gefühle erwidert. Ihr Vater, der sie in allen Lebenslagen berät, bedrängt sie, angesichts eines Stipendiums in England, den Underdog aufzugeben. Lloyd will sich mit der Trennung nicht abfinden. Als der vermeintliche Mustervater wegen Steuerhinterziehung ins Gefängnis muß und sich Diane emotionell von ihm lösen kann, wird der Weg frei für eine gemeinsame Zukunft.',
    description_ja: 'Average student and eternal optimist Lloyd Dobler seeks to capture the heart of Diane Court, a beautiful but unattainable valedictorian classmate. He surprises just about everyone - including himself - when she returns the sentiment. However, Diane\'s divorced, over-protective father soon begins to disapprove of the match, and Lloyd realises that it\'s going to take more than just the power of love to conquer all.',
    description_pt: 'Diane parece estar com a vida feita: melhor estudante da sua turma, tem uma bolsa de estudos na Inglaterra assegurada. Até que, no último verão antes de viajar, conhece Lloyd, um simpático rapaz com boas intenções, mas que não tem a mínima ideia do que quer fazer da sua vida.',
    rating_overall: 7.1, rating_story: 7.1, rating_acting: 7.2, rating_direction: 7, rating_cinematography: 6.8, rating_music: 6.6,
    imdb_rating: 7, rotten_tomatoes: 70,
    budget_million: 16.0,
    box_office_million: 20,
    duration: 100, language: 'EN', country: 'US',
    reviews_count: 4611, is_featured: false, release_date: '1989-04-14', tags: ['romance', 'comedy', 'drama', '1989', 'crowe'],
