    id: '2108', slug: 'everybody-s-fine', title: 'Everybody\'s Fine', title_ar: 'Everybody\'s Fine', year: 2009,
    director: 'Kirk Jones', director_ar: 'Kirk Jones',
    cast: ['Robert De Niro', 'Drew Barrymore', 'Kate Beckinsale', 'Sam Rockwell', 'Melissa Leo', 'Damian Young'],
    genres: ['drama'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnC4ypkpviWgp4aHsXvWym38v56.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mS6MvzEX4APTat5kq7hzKVGlgi7.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eVdPzkJiYo4',
    description_ar: 'Eight months after the death of his wife, Frank Goode looks forward to a reunion with his four adult children. When all of them cancel their visits at the last minute, Frank, against the advice of his doctor, sets out on a road trip to reconnect with his offspring. As he visits each one in turn, Frank finds that his children\'s lives are not quite as picture-perfect as they\'ve made them out to be.',
    description_en: 'Eight months after the death of his wife, Frank Goode looks forward to a reunion with his four adult children. When all of them cancel their visits at the last minute, Frank, against the advice of his doctor, sets out on a road trip to reconnect with his offspring. As he visits each one in turn, Frank finds that his children\'s lives are not quite as picture-perfect as they\'ve made them out to be.',
    description_fr: 'Un homme veuf décide de jouer les touristes à travers les Etats-Unis et de réunir ses quatre enfants, disséminés dans tout le pays, afin de reprendre contact...',
    description_es: 'Remake de la cinta de 1990 que dirigió Giuseppe Tornatore ("Stanno tutti bene"). Al jubilarse, un padre de familia viudo (De Niro), quiere reunir en torno a la mesa familiar a sus cuatro hijos. Cuando ve que ninguno de ellos se presenta, decide emprender un viaje para visitarlos, pero entonces descubre que la realidad de sus vidas nada tiene que ver con lo que él imaginaba.',
    description_tr: 'Frank yakın zamanda eşini kaybetmiş ve çocuklarıyla yalnız kalmış bir aile babasıdır. Bu yalnızlığın ve yaptığı yanlışların ardından çocuklarının aileden bir bir kopmasına seyirci kalan Frank, aradan geçen yılların sonunda ailesini tekrar bir araya toplamak için bir yolculuğa çıkar.',
    description_de: 'Der verwitwete Rentner Frank Goode hat seit dem Tod der Frau kaum noch Kontakt zu den eigenen Kindern. Er beschließt, alle vier einzuladen um als Familie beisammen sein zu können, doch der mittlerweile erwachsene und beruflich erfolgreiche Nachwuchs hat keine Zeit für den alten Herrn. Nacheinander treffen die Absagen ein, Frank bleibt allein. Wenn sie schon nicht zu ihm kommen wollen, dann muss es eben anders herum sein – gegen den Rat seines Arztes tritt Frank eine Busreise quer durch die USA an, um seinen vier Kindern einen Besuch abzustatten. Auf seiner Reise entdeckt Frank nicht nur ungeahnte Probleme seiner Kinder, sondern auch, dass seine verstorbene Frau die einzige echte Verbindung zu den Kindern war, die sich mittlerweile weit von ihm entfremdet haben …',
    description_ja: '成人した子供たちが家族の集まりに来ないと知り、妻をなくしたフランク・グードは各地に住む子供たちに会いに出かける。成功した幸せな暮らしぶりを見るつもりだったフランクだが、不意に訪れた彼が目にしたのは理想とは程遠い現実だった。',
    description_pt: 'Um viúvo (Robert De Niro) embarca numa viagem improvisada, para voltar a estar próximo de cada um dos seus filhos, já adultos, apenas para descobrir que as suas vidas estão longe de serem perfeitas.',
    rating_overall: 7, rating_story: 7, rating_acting: 7.1, rating_direction: 6.9, rating_cinematography: 6.7, rating_music: 6.5,
    imdb_rating: 6.8, rotten_tomatoes: 68,
    budget_million: 21.0,
