    id: '2133', slug: 'where-am-i-going', title: 'Where Am I Going?', title_ar: 'Quo vado?', year: 2016,
    director: 'Gennaro Nunziante', director_ar: 'Gennaro Nunziante',
    cast: ['Checco Zalone', 'Eleonora Giovanardi', 'Sonia Bergamasco', 'Ludovica Modugno', 'Maurizio Micheli', 'Paolo Pierobon'],
    genres: ['comedy', 'drama', 'adventure'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJ9w9tHdkLOs2hTJ4SAsBC0Bqtg.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/63rBFeEwUPAvHBElOL46nxfdyAW.jpg',
    description_ar: 'Checco is 39 and lived his entire life with his parents. He loves his job where he does nothing the whole day, until something happens that will change his behavior and his life forever...',
    description_en: 'Checco is 39 and lived his entire life with his parents. He loves his job where he does nothing the whole day, until something happens that will change his behavior and his life forever...',
    description_fr: 'Checco is 39 and lived his entire life with his parents. He loves his job where he does nothing the whole day, until something happens that will change his behavior and his life forever...',
    description_es: 'Narra las peripecias de un funcionario de una administración provincial, con quince años de servicio, que se dedica a la rutinaria pero cómoda tarea de expedir las licencias de caza y pesca. Vive feliz en casa de sus padres, mimado por su madre, y con una novia con la cual no tiene intención de casarse ni tener hijos. Pero su mundo se derrumba cuando el Estado decide eliminar las provincias. Antes que aceptar una indemnización y buscar otro trabajo, el protagonista acepta varios traslados a regiones remotas de Italia y finalmente se aviene incluso a trasladarse a Noruega para trabajar como guardián de una estación científica italiana en el Polo Norte.',
    description_tr: 'Checco İtalyanın küçük bir kasabasında yaşamının ayrıcalıklı olduğu tarafta doğdu. Hükümet bürokrasiyi azaltmak için yeni yasalar koyar. Checco tüm bunlara karşıdır ve aynı zamanda garanti iş olduğu için devlet memurudur. Bir yanda işi bir yanda baskıcı ve ayrımcı kurallar.Hangisini seçecektir?',
    description_de: 'Checco wohnt noch immer bei seinen Eltern, drückt sich vor Ehe nebst Vaterschaft und hat auch im Job den einfachen Weg gewählt: Er arbeitet in der Landesverwaltung für Jagd und Fischerei – unbefristet, ohne viel Aufwand und stets in berechtigter Erwartung der nächsten Bestechung. Doch mit der Reform der öffentlichen Verwaltung sieht Checco seine Privilegien schmelzen wie Eis in der italienischen Sonne. Vor die Wahl „Kündigung oder Versetzung“ gestellt, entscheidet sich Checco für Option Nr. 2. Die eiskalte Beamtin Sironi greift deswegen zu drastischen Maßnahmen: In der Hoffnung, dass er kündigt, schickt sie den renitenten Faulpelz an die abgelegensten Orte, sogar über die Grenzen Italiens hinaus .....',
    description_ja: 'Checco is 39 and lived his entire life with his parents. He loves his job where he does nothing the whole day, until something happens that will change his behavior and his life forever...',
    description_pt: 'Checco is 39 and lived his entire life with his parents. He loves his job where he does nothing the whole day, until something happens that will change his behavior and his life forever...',
    rating_overall: 7, rating_story: 7, rating_acting: 7.1, rating_direction: 6.9, rating_cinematography: 6.7, rating_music: 6.5,
