    id: '2137', slug: 'eden-lake', title: 'Eden Lake', title_ar: 'Eden Lake', year: 2008,
    director: 'James Watkins', director_ar: 'James Watkins',
    cast: ['Kelly Reilly', 'Michael Fassbender', 'Jack O\'Connell', 'Finn Atkins', 'Thomas Turgoose', 'James Burrows'],
    genres: ['horror', 'thriller'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOg6ElTe1mJwaCFN0172U4oso22.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/34fIB4TBdYHerdbcXoMVPZiX7q0.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fjR4Sk1nozM',
    description_ar: 'When a young couple goes to a remote wooded lake for a romantic getaway, their quiet weekend is shattered by an aggressive group of local kids. Rowdiness quickly turns to rage as the teens terrorize the couple in unimaginable ways, and a weekend outing becomes a bloody battle for survival.',
    description_en: 'When a young couple goes to a remote wooded lake for a romantic getaway, their quiet weekend is shattered by an aggressive group of local kids. Rowdiness quickly turns to rage as the teens terrorize the couple in unimaginable ways, and a weekend outing becomes a bloody battle for survival.',
    description_fr: 'Jenny est maîtresse d\'école. Son petit ami et elle quittent Londres pour passer un week-end romantique au bord d\'un lac. La tranquillité du lieu est perturbée par une bande d\'adolescents bruyants et agressifs qui s\'installent avec leur Rottweiler juste à côté d\'eux. A bout de nerfs, ces derniers leur demandent de baisser le son de leur radio. Grosse erreur !',
    description_es: 'Una pareja, Steve y Jenny, se escapa de fin de semana romántico. Sin embargo, su tranquilidad se verá interrumpida cuando una banda de chicos jóvenes aparezca por el lugar. Estos, como acto de rebeldía, robarán las cosas a la pareja y destrozarán su coche. Steve les hará frente pero sufrirá un violento ataque. A partir de ese momento, Jenny tratará de escapar a través del bosque...',
    description_tr: 'Anaokulu öğretmeni Jenny ve sevgilisi Steve, romantik bir hafta sonu için orman içinde bulunan bir göl kenarına giderler. Fakat bu sakin ve huzurlu yerde ortaya çıkan gençler kendilerini bu genç çifte kanıtlamak için güç gösterisine girip şiddet uygulamaya başlayınca, olaylar kendiliğinden gelişir ve kedi- fare kovalamacası vahşete dönüşür. İngiliz korku ve gerilim filmi olan Kan Gölü, sadece korkutma boş içerikli filmlerden öte şiddeti de sorguluyor.',
    description_de: 'Das Mittelklassepaar Jenny und Steve fahren zum Zelten an den von dichtem Wald umgebenen Eden Lake. Dort kommt es zum Konflikt und Pöbeleien mit einer Jugendbande. Das junge Paar bemerkt bald darauf den Diebstahl der Autoschlüssel und Handys. Sie stellen die Bande zur Rede doch es kommt zu einem folgenschweren Handgemenge in dessen Verlauf Steve den Hund des Anführers Brett tötet. Brett ist derart aufgebracht, dass er die Bande auffordert Steve und Jenny zu verfolgen …',
    description_ja: 'When a young couple goes to a remote wooded lake for a romantic getaway, their quiet weekend is shattered by an aggressive group of local kids. Rowdiness quickly turns to rage as the teens terrorize the couple in unimaginable ways, and a weekend outing becomes a bloody battle for survival.',
    description_pt: 'Steve planeou um fim-de-semana romântico à beira de um lago com a namorada Jenny. Porém, foram incomodados assim que chegaram pela presença de adolescentes arruaceiros. Após alguns incidentes, o líder do grupo, Brett, instiga os amigos a apedrejar o carro do casal e persegui-los pela floresta, para os torturarem e matarem. Poderão os dois pombinhos escapar com vida?',
    rating_overall: 7, rating_story: 7, rating_acting: 7.1, rating_direction: 6.9, rating_cinematography: 6.7, rating_music: 6.5,
    imdb_rating: 6.8, rotten_tomatoes: 68,
