    id: '2152', slug: 'the-spy-who-loved-me', title: 'The Spy Who Loved Me', title_ar: 'The Spy Who Loved Me', year: 1977,
    director: 'Lewis Gilbert', director_ar: 'Lewis Gilbert',
    cast: ['Roger Moore', 'Barbara Bach', 'Curd Jürgens', 'Richard Kiel', 'Caroline Munro', 'Walter Gotell'],
    genres: ['adventure', 'action', 'thriller'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZxHKFxMYvAko680DsRgAZKWcLi.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8lRdfsmJjUXQU3DMOOB3vVIhJxP.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqhzdF8m6q4',
    description_ar: 'Russian and British submarines with nuclear missiles on board both vanish from sight without a trace. England and Russia both blame each other as James Bond tries to solve the riddle of the disappearing ships. But the KGB also has an agent on the case.',
    description_en: 'Russian and British submarines with nuclear missiles on board both vanish from sight without a trace. England and Russia both blame each other as James Bond tries to solve the riddle of the disappearing ships. But the KGB also has an agent on the case.',
    description_fr: 'Pour retrouver des sous-marins nucléaires russe et britannique qui ont mystérieusement disparu, James Bond fait équipe avec l\'agent soviétique Anya Amasova. Leur mission les conduit à affronter un ennemi redoutable, Requin, un géant de près de deux mètres vingt quasiment indestructible et armé d\'une mâchoire en acier aussi coupante qu\'un rasoir. 007 devra également affronter Karl Stromberg, l\'employeur de Requin. Stromberg veut se servir des sous-marins nucléaires qu\'il a volés pour détruire le monde et créer une cité sous-marine.',
    description_es: 'La misteriosa desaparición de dos submarinos nucleares hace que colaboren los mejores operativos de los servicios secretos británico y soviético: James Bond y la mayor Amasova. Detrás de todo se encuentra el magnate Stromberg, cuya finalidad es la destrucción de la "corrupta" humanidad para fundar una civilización pura bajo el mar.',
    description_tr: 'Ruslar ve İngilizler, birer denizaltıları ortadan kaybolunca savaşın eşiğine gelirler. Ele geçirilen mikrofilm, denizaltıların üçüncü bir tarafın kontrolündeki bir teknolojiyle takip edilerek kaçırıldığını ortaya çıkarır. Bunun üzerine MI6\'in gözde ajanı James Bond ve güzel Rus ajanı Anya Amasova, güçlerini birleştirerek olayların şüphelisi milyarder işadamı Carl Stromberg\'in peşine düşerler. Stromberg\'ın amacı, nükleer denizaltıları kullanarak yer yüzünü yok etmek ve kurtulan insanlara denizlerin altında yeni bir yaşam imkanı sağlamaktır. Anya\'yla beraber çalışan Bond, kendisini güzel partnerine karşı da korumak zorundadır çünkü bir önceki görevinde onun sevgilisini öldürmek zorunda kalmıştır.',
    description_de: 'Ein russisches und ein amerikanisches U-Boot mit Atomraketen an Bord verschwinden spurlos von der Bildfläche. Amerikaner und Russen beschuldigen sich gegenseitig. James Bond soll das Rätsel der verschwundenen U-Boote lösen. Aber auch der KGB hat schon einen Agenten losgeschickt.',
    description_ja: '核ミサイルを搭載した英潜水艦「レンジャー」とソ連潜水艦「ポチョムキン」が突如消息を絶った。調査を命ぜられたボンドはエジプト・カイロへ飛び、そこで同じ目的でソ連が派遣したKGBの女スパイ、アニヤと出会う。  共同で任務に当たるが、事件の直前、オーストリアでボンドに差し向けられ、返り討ちにあったソ連の殺し屋が彼女の恋人だった。「この任務が終わったら、あなたを殺すわ」そう言われたボンドは彼女と共にアメリカ海軍の潜水艦に乗り込み、怪しいとにらんだストロンバーグ海運のタンカーに接近する。  ストロンバーグは米ソを核攻撃し、世界を壊滅させ、海の世界を作ろうとしていた…。',
    description_pt: 'James Bond  e a bela agente soviética Anya Amasova  juntam-se para investigar o desaparecimento de submarinos nucleares, aliados e russos. As pistas levam-nos ao bilionário Karl Stromberg. Depressa, Bond e Anya tornam-se a última esperança de conseguir acabar com um plano que irá levar o mundo a um holocausto nuclear.',
    rating_overall: 7, rating_story: 7, rating_acting: 7.1, rating_direction: 6.9, rating_cinematography: 6.7, rating_music: 6.5,
    imdb_rating: 6.8, rotten_tomatoes: 68,
    budget_million: 13.5,
    box_office_million: 185,
    duration: 125, language: 'EN', country: 'GB',
    reviews_count: 1604, is_featured: false, release_date: '1977-07-07', tags: ['adventure', 'action', 'thriller', '1977', 'gilbert'],
